{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4e699dd5a52ba897754755b03d810ecb36fd1e1fff02a4d814948d4dd3e7977a", "ja": "（次の公演の事で琴葉を探している……と言ったら、\n何故か歩と美也が、はりきって探し始めてしまった）", "zh": "（我才说了要找琴叶讲下一场公演的事……\n结果不知道为什么，步跟美也就卯足了劲开始找她。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9147131d0422ed53c66d6656db1dc27226424a2764243661a380bdd88641fd21", "ja": "はあ、はあ……。琴葉、どこぉ～！？\nビッグニュース！　ビッグニュースだよ！", "zh": "呼、呼……琴叶，你在哪～！？\n有个大消息！大消息喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "dd8da5f762a833f0ed4403db8d83e24c99ec438e7085149e30244afab36854cb", "ja": "あっ……歩さん、{$P$}さん、\nこっちです～。控え室から、声がしますよ～。", "zh": "啊……步姊、{$P$}先生，\n在这里～我听到琴叶的声音从准备室里传出来～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "46110ac34f58c11845d93ead4bbb3d836c5d7644e6fc00e069e88dc1828269bc", "ja": "いたー！　琴葉、控え室にいたんだ。\n探しちゃったよ～！", "zh": "找到了──！琴叶，原来你在准备室里啊。\n我们找你找了好久～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "93f53d57a0840981202ebede1f73b890a9aa3e1a3ebbaf9aa7690608749eae86", "ja": "琴葉ちゃん、琴葉ちゃん。{$P$}さん\nから、とっても大事なお知らせだそうですよ～。", "zh": "琴叶、琴叶。{$P$}先生\n好像有很重要的事要跟你说喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "497a408a5841bc51978552eca2a4f989329549e1d0875f16eb268781596ca352", "ja": "歩、美也。それに{$P$}まで。\nビッグニュースって、何かあったんですか？", "zh": "不只步跟美也，连{$P$}都来了。\n有什么大消息？发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1006_p", "source_sha256": "98f783b60d4b66bef0442c7e9e8e2003890e566341e2836da5298e73431ed205", "ja": "ああ。実は次の公演で、琴葉に\nセンターをお願いしようと思ってるんだ。", "zh": "嗯，其实是我想请琴叶担任下次公演的Center。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "dae4785ca9f9780c65cd3894292b69820f1e8263672264616ef8dfee1474a775", "ja": "えっ……わ、私ですか！？", "zh": "咦……我、我吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "22aa303004c73e82c40d72ba28539286d823707a8157f0566a26c50c7c70d647", "ja": "おおーっ。\nやったじゃん、琴葉☆", "zh": "哦哦──\n太好了呢，琴叶☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "fdd4e203f60ecae8870cbc9d472ba2f76e7c7afc5b909a8fbc806b77160f51c0", "ja": "コトハがセンターかぁ……どんなステージに\nなるのかナ？　エヘヘ、楽しみだネ♪", "zh": "由琴叶担任Center啊……会成为什么样的表演呢？\n嘿嘿，真令人期待♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1010_p", "source_sha256": "99b2090bea0d6690cf96913c2d8c3628cbb9b6f6adce3bf4a0ee7a66832cb4a1", "ja": "恵美とエレナもいたなら、ちょうど良かった。\nふたりと、それに歩、美也……。", "zh": "正巧惠美跟艾琳娜也在。\n你们两位，还有步、美也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1011_p", "source_sha256": "aa7137a38f37b0d534ebf0a0dd93cb9e3891a48b57d2d7ad7d8e0a860847ee74", "ja": "4人には、公演のサポートをしてもらおうと\n思ってるんだ。よろしくな！", "zh": "我想请你们四个协助这场公演。\n麻烦你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "33c749457b8b09c82def5c672a36423e868cae2f05352f8b1d7db65df62762e1", "ja": "オッケー、{$P$}！\nもちろんアタシたちも手伝うよ。な、美也！", "zh": "OK，{$P$}！\n我们当然也要帮忙，对吧，美也！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "5aedd37c39cd6d245fc96f212fdac24334e3b4688df2c46d0cd43843c630b192", "ja": "はい～、がんばりますよ～。\n琴葉ちゃん、いっしょにがんばりましょうね～。", "zh": "嗯～我会加油的～\n琴叶，我们一起加油吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9c4677f532536a13325a0a06ec5eedf54f7d654c42e11bf1a011a0e648bd1fcb", "ja": "どうだ、琴葉。引き受けてくれるか？", "zh": "怎么样？琴叶。你愿意接下这份工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "cf16bb21ee94cff0a622fea51f465b6c345c9da65f148c0383035fd8dc4a6c4b", "ja": "コトハ？", "zh": "琴叶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "a6ef8173136267ee1511e38f9d6018faba98481f0d112b000dca5bf759b719ec", "ja": "あっ……ご、ごめん。\nなんでもないの。", "zh": "啊……抱、抱歉。\n没什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "a80c1589c41565866adece086537f6c050b9077f5c973d52e02abd24bf67e739", "ja": "私に、センターなんて大役が務まるのか、\nわかりません。けど……。", "zh": "我不确定自己是否足以担任Center这个重要角色。\n不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "0ad0b145378024d73cca57b9c707b264f22a09017894d8bc93666b5048339ee8", "ja": "{$P$}からの、指名です。\n期待を裏切らないよう、精いっぱいがんばります！", "zh": "既然{$P$}选择了我。\n我会拚命努力，回应你的期待的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "b6272239d50444a62965de0386ac4c0777ce82f49f1dcc087b0d336bffe6e169", "ja": "にゃははっ、相変わらず琴葉は真面目だな～。\nもっと気楽にいこうよ。ね、{$P$}！", "zh": "呀哈哈，琴叶还是老样子这么认真～放轻松点吧。\n对不对，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1021_p", "source_sha256": "a9a2968a30d971e104808ad218a48928e1facaa7433f7cfa464cb2331a40477a", "ja": "そうだな。琴葉らしさが出せるのが一番だ。\nまずはどんな事がやりたいか、考えてみてほしい。", "zh": "是啊，最重要的是展现出琴叶自己的特色。\n我希望你可以先想一下自己想做什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1022_017kth", "source_sha256": "6045fb8d2efbb28813b9e01f71ad05ed70dce3201fc496eee30bc4b736dab3c1", "ja": "どんなことがやりたいか……ですか。\n……。", "zh": "自己想做什么吗……？\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1023_018ele", "source_sha256": "95b7544f5a7d633d45888bd9b195e798db0d4633ede5b8e34dcebe603f2a5cf5", "ja": "コ～トハ♪　ほっぺが引きつってるヨ～？\nリラックスリラックス♪", "zh": "琴～叶♪你的眉头都皱在一起了啦～\n放轻松放轻松♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "2b5396db123e36afea1fbab0aeee1e2d6fa0fe7cb75238022c78faf6cf87b506", "ja": "よし！　それじゃこれから、みんなで作戦会議だ！\nというワケだから、ファミレス行くよ～っ♪", "zh": "好！那么等一下，大家就来开作战会议！\n我们一起去家庭餐厅吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1025_042miy", "source_sha256": "4cbf2a39ae929dca4ed3aaefc02aa7faa0ac198b00c80bd3b3a84955fad5d54b", "ja": "おお～、いいですな～。\n琴葉ちゃん、ゆっくりお話しましょうね～。", "zh": "喔喔～这个提议不错～\n琴叶，我们去餐厅慢慢聊吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1026_034ayu", "source_sha256": "96cda699c07f85eb8915eb76836efab6688b66e022878e33d1728b18123b686b", "ja": "話もいいけど、作戦会議も忘れないようにしないと！\n公演の主役は琴葉なんだからさっ。", "zh": "要聊天是可以，但可别忘了作战会议！\n毕竟公演的主角是琴叶啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1027_017kth", "source_sha256": "3ae53368321457225dfe80aee4c58bb64e155e4c84f9f201be23b0f8823a83e3", "ja": "ま、待って、みんな！　次の公演まで\nあまり時間もないし、レッスンしたほうが……。", "zh": "等、等一下，大家！距离下一场公演也没剩\n多少时间了，还是先练习比较好吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1028_020meg", "source_sha256": "de01b96584468e13b97842c8e7b0bd100507b64bb050c798f0eec6d51ff8a85f", "ja": "1日ぐらい大丈夫だって～。\nほら、行こ行こっ！", "zh": "才一天而已不要紧啦～\n好了，走吧走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1029_p", "source_sha256": "3aaebbc45c84a6e3bf3221928c5875ab4977122a09a5ddc437ddec0eea0b1ca3", "ja": "作戦会議、楽しそうだし、いいんじゃないか？\nいってらっしゃい、気をつけてな！", "zh": "作战会议感觉很有趣，没什么不好喔。\n你们慢走，路上小心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1030_017kth", "source_sha256": "8e8acae9afa476f90167297ffeeb03f0b284e750f363ff2308617f579e306295", "ja": "{$P$}……\nす、すみません。ちょっと、いってきます！", "zh": "{$P$}……\n不、不好意思，那我们先出发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_034_1031_p", "source_sha256": "33e799519a0bfcda5e19c76dd25aff4fc36ec5f60b8cfbf427a8b049a7e094da", "ja": "（琴葉は、ちょっと考えすぎるタイプだからな。けど、\n頼もしい仲間の存在が、力を与えてくれるはずだ！）", "zh": "（毕竟琴叶是个容易想太多的女孩。\n不过，这些可靠的伙伴，一定能为她带来力量的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
